Models

This folder contains the machine learning model implementations and trained model artifacts used in the AQI Prediction System.

Contents

- lstm_model.py– Python implementation of the LSTM model.
- xgboost_model.py – Python implementation of the XGBoost model.
- hybrid_model.py – Code for the hybrid prediction model.
- artifact_loader.py – Utility for loading saved model artifacts.
- lstm_model.keras – Saved trained LSTM model.
- xgboost_model.pkl – Saved XGBoost model.
- hybrid_meta.pkl – Saved hybrid meta-model.
- preprocessor.pkl – Saved preprocessing object.
- bengaluru , delhi, mumbai – City-specific model folders.

Purpose

This folder stores the models and related files required for generating AQI predictions.
